Current Dev Position: YP 2.6 M4.

Next Deadline: YP 2.6 M4 Build Target is Oct. 1, 2018


SWAT Team Rotation:

=B7         SWAT lead is currently: Chen

=B7         SWAT team rotation: Chen -> Armin on Sept. 28, 2018

=B7         SWAT team rotation: Armin -> Paul on Oct. 5, 2018

=B7         https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_Build_Failure_Swat_Tea=
m


Key Status/Updates:

=B7         2.6 M3 rc1 has been built and is in QA.  See https://wiki.yocto=
project.org/wiki/2.6_QA_Status. It has just begun.

=B7         We=92re now past feature freeze and all major changes planned f=
or 2.6 have been merged so only bug fixes will be accepted now.

=B7         There were a number of issues leading up to the M3 build:

o    we upgraded openssh to a git version which includes openssl 1.1 suppor=
t.

o    qemuarm64 was hanging upon boot which was tracked down to an entropy i=
ssue

o    there have been a number of good kernel warning fixes/cleanups as well=
 as the more usual stable version updates.

o    the gnupg-native issues were resolved. (thanks Ross)

o    ARC support was mostly merged as an unofficial (untested) architecture=
.

o    A pseudo bug was identified with large inode numbers and a fix merged.

=B7         Builds in general are building with fewer warnings, those remai=
ning have open bugs.

=B7         The new autobuilder based on buildbot =91nine=92 is now visible=
 at: https://autobuilder.yoctoproject.org/typhoon/#/console and the older s=
ystems are being decommissioned with the workers being transferred to typho=
on. A number of issues have been identified (QA email sending, wiki log han=
dling of builds with warnings but not errors and the build failure emails) =
which are being worked upon, some have already been fixed.


Planned Releases for YP 2.6:

=B7         YP 2.6 M3 Release Target was Sept. 7, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M4 Build Target is Oct. 1, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M4 Release Target is Oct. 26, 2018


Planned upcoming dot releases:

=B7         YP 2.4.4 (Rocko) will be targeted after YP 2.6 M4 is done.

=B7         YP 2.5.2 (Sumo) will be targeted after YP 2.4.4 is done.


Tracking Metrics:

=B7         WDD 2562 (last week 2589) (https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/charts=
/combo.html)

=B7         Poky Patch Metrics

o    Total patches found: 1658 (last week 1646)

o    Percentage of patches in the Pending State: 732 (44%) [last week 736 (=
45%)]


